{"id": "biz-1", "headline": "Sanofi to buy Insmed in $41B biopharma deal", "source": "STAT News", "url": "https://www.statnews.com/pharmalot/2026/11/24/sanofi-buying-insmed-roche-breast-cancer-pill/", "published": "2026-11-24", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Sanofi said it will buy biotech Insmed for $41 billion, the largest biopharma acquisition in years. The French drugmaker will get two approved lung disease medicines from the New Jersey company, plus another drug in Phase 3 trials. The deal reflects pressure on Sanofi from looming revenue losses on its blockbuster inflammatory drug Dupixent. The company has said openly that it was looking for takeover targets with late-stage or clinical assets. The purchase shows large drugmakers are still willing to pay heavily to refill pipelines as top products near the end of patent protection. Source: STAT News."], "qr": {"n": 37, "rows": ["1111111001110010101001100010001111111", "1000001000011010010001100110001000001", "1011101001110010000101010011101011101", "1011101010110100010001011101101011101", "1011101010101010101110010010101011101", "1000001001100000111010001010101000001", "1111111010101010101010101010101111111", "0000000001001000100010110000000000000", "1100011101101111010100011101000011000", "1001010111100111011111110111010110010", "1000011010011001101001100111111101101", "0010000000010011001010101010110100010", "1100111000100001100110011010101101011", "0001110101001101101110010011110101110", "0111111000100011000010000101001010111", "0111010000001011000000111011110100101", "1111001011101110011000100101101011101", "0110000111000101111110110011100101110", "0011111011001101010101010111000110001", "1110100010110000000010110000000101001", "0100101010010101010100111101011110111", "1100000011001111001101011001000111110", "1001111001000111111011001101001100111", "1001010111001011001100100000010001001", "1110011000111111100100010010101100001", "1100010010100001100111011011100101010", "100001110101100111100100111101000011